{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1529949-time-of-judgment-retrospective-20-years-later","id":1529949,"title":"Time of Judgment Retrospective: 20 Years Later","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2024-02-03T18:30:13-08:00","id":1529949,"title":"Time of Judgment Retrospective: 20 Years Later","content":"So, this year will mark 20 years since the Classic World of Darkness ended for the first time. As much as I personally detest the metaplot of WoD as a whole, I will admit I respect the hustle of White Wolf actually delivering on bringing about Gehenna, the Apocalypse, and so on.<br /> <br /> And so, I want to start a thread looking back on all of the Time of Judgment books (Gehenna, Apocalypse, Ascension, WoD: Time of Judgment, End Game) and the books that were seen as major leadups to said event (Ends of Empire, Time of Thin Blood, Rage Across The Heavens, Lair of the Hidden, The Red Sign, pretty much every Demon release)<br /> <br /> And I also encourage people to write up their own TOJ scenarios for any of the Legacy WoD gamelines or even for the fan games too.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm just a trans guy and gaming fan, unabashed hedonist and unusually upbeat nihilist, fairly laid back. He/Him.<br /> <br /> If everything is political, then nothing is!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25920-matt-corleone","name":"Matt Corleone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25920_8.webp","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"393"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-04T12:46:35-08:00","id":1529979,"title":"","content":"My take is don't let the metaplot get in the way of making a good story. If you want it that Michael didn't suffer final death at the hands of his former lover Mariah and you can come up with a great story hook. Then have at it. In regards to Gehenna the one character I really started to feel for was Lilith as she was given a worse deal then Caine in some ways in regards as she was denied the one thing that could make her long life bearable.<br /> <br /> Being denied the power to love and feel love in turn is a worse punishment then most.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-04T14:06:16-08:00","id":1529983,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lysander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1529949-time-of-judgment-retrospective-20-years-later?p=1529979#post1529979\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">My take is don't let the metaplot get in the way of making a good story. If you want it that Michael didn't suffer final death at the hands of his former lover Mariah and you can come up with a great story hook. Then have at it. In regards to Gehenna the one character I really started to feel for was Lilith as she was given a worse deal then Caine in some ways in regards as she was denied the one thing that could make her long life bearable.<br /> <br /> Being denied the power to love and feel love in turn is a worse punishment then most.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Yup, I pretty much reject the metaplot in its entirety but still, I find some of the TOJ stuff fascinating from a certain perspective.<br /> <br /> For me, the Andrew Greenburg Era (1991-1994) never ended while Revised and V5 never happened at all, BUT with that said, there's a part of me that wants to incorporate some limited elements of the metaplot for a very specific long-term chronicle that eventually marches to the big end.<br /> <br /> I'd avoid the more egregious metaplot stuff I didn't like (The Week of Nightmares, Gangrel leaving the Camarilla while Assamites join in, Stargazers leaving the Garou Nation, the Avatar Storm) but I may incorporate other elements.<br /> <br /> Here's the thing, I want to include the Sixth Great Maelstrom in some form, but can you do it without including the Week of Nightmares or the Avatar Storm? What if the Sixth Great Maelstrom was instead caused by an entirely different event?<br /> <br /> I also want to make some dark comedy Time of Judgment scenarios for Senshi: The Merchandising too.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm just a trans guy and gaming fan, unabashed hedonist and unusually upbeat nihilist, fairly laid back. He/Him.<br /> <br /> If everything is political, then nothing is!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25920-matt-corleone","name":"Matt Corleone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25920_8.webp","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"393"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-04T15:29:00-08:00","id":1529984,"title":"","content":"The Sixth Great Maelstrom had two potential causes as I recall. The Technocracy\u2019s Spirit Nuke contributed but it was detonating the Relic Nuke in the Labyrinth that really kicked it off. You can drop all the Ravnos stuff and still have the Maelstrom.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Mage: The Ice-ension: An Epic Game of Reality on the Rink","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/758-ramnesis","name":"Ramnesis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar758_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2220"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-04T18:07:59-08:00","id":1529992,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ramnesis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1529949-time-of-judgment-retrospective-20-years-later?p=1529984#post1529984\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Sixth Great Maelstrom had two potential causes as I recall. The Technocracy\u2019s Spirit Nuke contributed but it was detonating the Relic Nuke in the Labyrinth that really kicked it off. You can drop all the Ravnos stuff and still have the Maelstrom.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Excellent. I'll have it to where the Sixth Great Maelstrom still happens but the Week of Nightmares never happened and the Ravnos Clan are just fine and dandy.<br /> <br /> Also, instead of tying Senshi: The Merchandising into Mage's consensual reality, I'm going to tie it into Hunter: The Reckoning instead with the Messengers creating the Senshi and the youma being some sort of brand new force aligned with the Wyrm/Oblivion to advance the impending apocalypse even further.<br /> <br /> When the Messengers call upon adults, it creates Imbued but out of some odd warped form of mercy, whenever the Messengers call upon children and teenagers, it creates Senshi instead (and a few rare adult Senshi do exist, aged between 18 and 21) <br /> <br /> The Imbued barely have enough edges to give them a fighting chance but the Senshi have the power of God and anime on their side in an unusually literal sense.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm just a trans guy and gaming fan, unabashed hedonist and unusually upbeat nihilist, fairly laid back. He/Him.<br /> <br /> If everything is political, then nothing is!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25920-matt-corleone","name":"Matt Corleone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25920_8.webp","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"393"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}